d costs with the study team.", "id": "utsw-solid-cpmv", "notes": "Weekly intratumoral CPMV immunotherapy for naturally occurring canine solid tumors.", "species": "Dog", "state": "Texas", "status": "Actively recruiting — confirmed on the institution’s current clinical-trials page", "status_confidence": "confirmed_current", "study_type": "treatment", "title": "Intratumoral cowpea mosaic virus immunotherapy for canine solid tumors", "url": "https://www.utsouthwestern.edu/departments/radiation-oncology/veterinary-research-oncology-clinic/clinical-trials.html", "verified": "2026-09-05"}
